### DevQuest API — Auth Endpoints
### Install VS Code extension: REST Client (humao.rest-client)
### Jalankan: npm run dev di apps/api

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@contentType = application/json

# Simpan token setelah login/register untuk dipakai di endpoint protected
@accessToken = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_DISINI
@refreshToken = PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_DISINI


### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. REGISTER
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "budi@devquest.id",
  "username": "budi_dev",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. LOGIN
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "budi@devquest.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. REFRESH TOKEN
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "refresh_token": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. GET PROFILE (Protected)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. LOGOUT (Protected)
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────
### TEST CASES: Error Scenarios
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────

### Duplicate email → 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "budi@devquest.id",
  "username": "user_lain",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Wrong password → 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "budi@devquest.id",
  "password": "salah_password"
}

###

### Invalid body → 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "bukan-email",
  "username": "ab",
  "password": "short"
}

###

### No token → 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

###
